 [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Click on the correct word to complete the sentence. "}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le06ob02re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le06ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le06ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn6le06ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Have you heard of the paintings called \u201cIrises\u201d or \u201cThe Starry Night\u201d? These are two of the most well-known works of art by the Master Artist, Vincent Van Gogh. Throughout his life, he experimented with different forms, colors and styles of painting."}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn6le06ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "When he moved to France in 1888, he was influenced Impressionism, a popular trend at that time.  Elements of Impressionism include small, thin brushstrokes and accurate depiction of light as it changes in a composition. Van Gogh became devoted to perfecting his use of light in his paintings."}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn6le06ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "The melancholy outlook he had on life is reflected in his art. As he got older, his started to behave more erratically and unpredictably. His brother, Theo, did his best to help him and visited him often."}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn6le06ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "Eventually, Van Gogh's depression caused him to shoot himself in the chest. He died two days later at the age of 37. His paintings show us his genius and his unique representation of reality."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le06ob02re5aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Have you heard of the paintings called <span class=\"italic\">Irises</span> or <span class=\"italic\">The Starry Night</span>? These are two of the most well-known works of art by the Master Artist, Vincent van Gogh. Throughout his life, he experimented with different forms, colors and styles of painting."}, {"time": "17000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "When he moved to France in 1888, he was influenced by Impressionism, a popular trend at that time. Elements of Impressionism include small, thin brushstrokes and accurate depiction of light as it changes in a composition. Van Gogh became devoted to perfecting his use of light in his paintings."}, {"time": "38500", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "The melancholy outlook he had on life is reflected in his art. As he got older, his started to behave more erratically and unpredictably. His brother, Theo, did his best to help him and visited him often."}, {"time": "53700", "image": "", "id": 4, "text": "Eventually, van Gogh's depression caused him to shoot himself in the chest. He died two days later at the age of 37. His paintings show us his genius and his unique representation of reality."}], "video_src": "engenn6le06ob02re2vid"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 3, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Famous Artists"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Master Artist"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Grammar - part 1 > Superstars Today"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le06ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbs of Manner"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done.<br> Example: <br>She walked slowly.                     \t<br>How did she walk? Slowly."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"strong\"> -ly</span> to an adjective: <br><span class=\"italic\">Examples:  sad - sadly,  curious - curiously</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some adverbs are formed by adding  <span class=\"strong\">-ally</span>:<br> <span class=\"italic\">Example:  comic - comically</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The adverbs <span class=\"strong\">fast, hard, well </span>and <span class=\"strong\">straight </span> are exceptions. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He learned quickly. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "She ran fast. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He studied hard. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "They behaved unpredictably. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Van Gogh behaved erratically."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a general direction that something is going in "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Impressionism was a trend at the time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about an artist."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brushstroke "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "one stroke of a paintbrush"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh used small, thin brushstrokes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "composition "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " work of art "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh painted many compositions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "accurate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "exact; detailed "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh used accurate brushstrokes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "melancholy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "feeling sad "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh had a melancholy outlook on life.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "erratically"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a manner that is hard to predict "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh often behaved erratically."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "unpredictably"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a manner that is hard to predict; erratically "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh began to behave more unpredictably."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "unique"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "different; one of a kind "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh's paintings are unique."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "genius"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "exceptional creative or intellectual power "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Van Gogh was a genius."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "devoted "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " very loving or loyal"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Van Gogh was devoted to perfecting his skill."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob02aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use the Present Perfect and the Past simple for  events that started or happened in the past. <br/> <br/>The difference is that the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> is used for  past events that happened at a very specific time,  while actions with no specific time are expressed in the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span>. <br/><br/> You can also use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> when the past finished action has  a connection with the present. Observe the set of examples:"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I've loved The Starry Night from the first time I saw it.<br/> It has been one of my favorite paintings ever.<br/> Art has changed my life.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are irregular verbs in the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span>.  They have significant, unpredictable changes in the Simple Past tense. Here are some examples: <br/> <span class=\"strong\"><br/>Examples</span>:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I  <span class=\"strong\">heard</span> of van Gogh when I was at school.(to hear)<br/> I  <span class=\"strong\">saw</span> many attractive paintings at the museum last night.(to see) <br/>Sadly, he  <span class=\"strong\">shot</span> himself in the chest. (to shoot)</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span>, you use the <span class=\"strong\">auxiliary verb have </span>or <span class=\"strong\">has</span>.<br/>  The name of the tense is Present Perfect because the conjugation of the  auxiliary verb follows the rules of the Simple Present form. Let's remember:<br/><br/>  <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">love</span> art. I have <span class=\"strong\">loved </span> art all my life.<br/> He <span class=\"strong\">loves</span> art.  He has <span class=\"strong\">loved</span> art all her life.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Apart from the auxiliary verb have/has, you need the  principal verb or action in the <span class=\"strong\">Past Participle form</span>.  Some verbs can be irregular verbs. They can have little changes  or significant changes. Sometimes, these changes are the same you see  in the Simple Past. Look at the examples:<br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\">She has <span class=\"strong\">bought</span>  a new portrait. She <span class=\"strong\">bought</span> it last week.<br/> I  <span class=\"strong\">have heard</span> of van Gogh once.  I  <span class=\"strong\">heard</span> of him at school.</span>"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Do some research about a famous artist from your country. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph about their life. (10-15 sentences)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe how they lived and what their art is like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner about their favorite artist."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a famous artist from my country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a short paragraph about their life."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the information with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask my partner about their favorite artist."}]}]}